TI  - Discordance between global versus reductionist approach in competency-based assessment for medical students in a transition to residency course
PY  - 2026
T2  - Medical Teacher
VL  - 48
IS  - 3
SP  - 506
EP  - 515
DO  - 10.1080/0142159X.2025.2566967
